      { "speaker": "Waiter", "native": "ଶହେ କୋଡ଼ିଏ ଟଙ୍କା, ଆଜ୍ଞା।", "roman": "sôhe koṛie ṭôṅka, agya.", "en": "A hundred and twenty rupees, sir." }
    ]
